  "description": {
    "sub_id3": null,
    "sub_name": "產業競爭分析",
    "sub_ename": "INDUSTRY COMPETITION ANALYSIS",
    "describe_ch": "本課程探討產業的生命週期各階段的競爭優勢及因應策略。本課程透過企業個案研討同學能學習到：1. 運用產業分析的工具與技巧，培養系統性之分析與規劃能力。2.分析產業生命週期各階段的競爭策略。3.能運用理論知識、觀念能力及適當之方法、工具，對企業之發展方向及資源分配進行整體性、前瞻性之理解與思考。",
    "describe_eh": "This course studies the competitive advantages and strategies for a industry in various product life cycle stages. Students can learn  (1)the application of industry analysis tools, skills, and training of systematic analysis and planning abilities. (2)analyze the competitive strategies for a industry in different product life cycle stages. (3)use theoretic knowledge and proper methodology to comprehend and consider the industry development direction, resources allocation and perspectives.",
    "pre_subname": "",
    "pre_sub_id3": null,
    "pre_sub_ename": "",
